Usage: copilot plugin marketplace remove [OPTIONS] <name>

Remove a marketplace.

Unregisters a marketplace. If plugins from this marketplace are installed, use
--force to remove the marketplace and uninstall its plugins.

Arguments:
  <name>
          Marketplace name

Options:
  -f, --force
          Force removal even if plugins are installed

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

Examples:
  # Remove a marketplace
  $ copilot plugin marketplace remove my-marketplace

  # Force removal even if plugins are installed
  $ copilot plugin marketplace remove my-marketplace --force

Learn More:
  Use `copilot <command> --help` for more information about a command.
  Read the documentation at https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/copilot-cli
